=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# environment item1-doas-refuse --------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Treatment doas-refuse: item 1 on alpine323 refuses before$
# asking, as sudoers.PlanFor refuses an env-only Policy on doas$
# (ErrEnvNeedsGrant).$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [ ] Under doas           Not kept$
   -  Value                Not set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Under doas           Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
   2) Guide                How to set HARDN_CONFIG$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
# Warning$
# doas keeps HARDN_CONFIG only on a rule for alice alone, and$
# hardn has none. Add setenv { HARDN_CONFIG } to the rule that$
# lets alice use doas.$
$
$

